      "value": "Marking this as complete. The documentation is mostly done, but I'll be tweaking it a bit more as we approach release.\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/v2019.2.5/docs/vrc_spatialaudiosource\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/v2019.2.5/docs/vrc_voiceoverrideregion",
